    "statement": "Over the deployed KoalaBear field F_(2130706433^6), normalize a=2, xi=1/2, eta=c, ell=d and w=1/c. For both allocations of the doubled target roots 2 and 1/d to the two residual quadratics, all four generic endpoint-line pairs have only collision or inversion-fixed resultant-gcd support. In the direct allocation, the full leading-zero loci add only (c,d)=(5,5/7),(-7/5,53/55) on the excluded z=1 locus and a c=-2 fiber forcing d=2 or 1/2. The swapped allocation has only the previously classified quadratic z=1 component and forbidden support. Independent direct/resultant and fraction-free/Bezout paths reproduce every support modulo p=2130706433. Thus both necessary q-slice charts are empty; the other twelve affine positive charts, projective boundary, and negative loci remain open.",
